flow "A release with a safety gate"
node Start shape=terminal label="Ready for review"
node Tests label="Run checks" sublabel="Tests, lint, package"
node Gate shape=decision label="Checks pass?"
node Ship shape=terminal label="Publish release"
node Fix label="Resolve failures"
Start -> Tests -> Gate
Gate => Ship: yes
Gate -> Fix: no
Fix -> Tests: retry
highlight Ship
